Source: sslutils
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libssl-dev, postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/EnterpriseDB/sslutils

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-sslutils
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-sslutils
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PostgreSQL extension for managing SSL certificates through SQL
 SSLUtils provides SSL certificate generation and management functions to
 PostgreSQL for use by the Postgres Enterprise Manager server.
